Troubleshooting Tips
Issue: Permission denied when running tcpdump

Solution: Use sudo with tcpdump commands or add user to pcap group
Issue: Python script not finding modules

Solution: Ensure Python 3 is installed and scripts use #!/usr/bin/env python3
Issue: No traffic captured in pcap file

Solution: Verify correct interface with ip addr and ensure traffic is generated during capture
Issue: OpenSSL certificate retrieval fails

Solution: Check network connectivity and firewall rules; some hosts may block certificate queries
Issue: HTTP server port already in use

Solution: Use different port or kill existing process: kill $(lsof -t -i:8080)
